{
  "title": "Step Functions · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "여러 작업의 순서·분기·재시도를 워크플로로 관리합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Step Functions</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#guide-1\">상태 머신으로 업무 흐름 정의</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#guide-2\">실행 방식과 부작용 관리</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>52 / 62</span></div><h1>Step Functions</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Step Functions는 <strong>여러 서비스의 작업을 순서와 조건에 맞춰 실행하는 워크플로 서비스</strong>입니다. 각 작업의 결과를 다음 단계에 전달하고, 실패 시 재시도나 다른 경로로의 처리를 정의할 수 있습니다.</p><p>업무 로직을 한 함수 안에 모두 넣기보다 결제, 재고 확인, 배송 요청처럼 독립된 단계로 나눠 관리할 때 유용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"states-and-amazon-states-language\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"standard-workflows\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"express-workflows\"></span><h2>상태 머신으로 업무 흐름 정의</h2><p>상태 머신<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>에 실행할 작업과 다음 단계, 조건 분기, 병렬 처리 등을 정의합니다. Lambda뿐 아니라 지원 AWS 서비스의 API와 통합해 작업할 수 있습니다.</p><p>Retry와 Catch로 일시적인 실패와 복구 경로를 구성합니다. 작업 완료를 기다리거나 외부의 승인 결과를 받아 다음 단계로 넘어가는 방식도 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"request-response-run-a-job-and-callback\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"retry-catch-and-timeouts\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"parallel-and-map-states\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"iam-and-execution-history\"></span><h2>실행 방식과 부작용 관리</h2><p>긴 실행과 자세한 실행 이력, 지원되는 서비스 통합 방식이 중요하면 Standard를, 높은 호출량의 짧은 작업에는 Express의 조건을 검토합니다. 실행·과금·전달 특성이 다릅니다.</p><p>재시도로 결제나 발송 같은 작업이 중복될 수 있는지 확인합니다. 각 단계가 같은 요청을 다시 받아도 안전하게 처리하도록 만들고 실패 시 보상 작업을 설계합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>주문 워크플로의 예</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>주문 확인</strong><span>입력·재고 검증</span></li><li><strong>결제 처리</strong><span>성공·실패 분기</span></li><li><strong>배송 요청</strong><span>다음 업무 시작</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">각 단계에 재시도, 실패 처리, 필요한 보상 작업을 정의할 수 있습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>결제가 성공한 주문만 배송 단계로 보냅니다. 결제 실패는 사용자 안내로 분기하고 배송 요청의 일시적 장애는 재시도하도록 구성합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>상태 머신</strong> — 현재 실행 단계와 단계 사이의 이동 규칙을 표현한 구조입니다. 작업, 대기, 분기, 종료 등의 상태로 업무 흐름을 구성합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/step-functions/latest/dg/welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Step Functions? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q076/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q076\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q076\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q076</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q076/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workflow must explicitly handle branching, retries, and compensation across payment, inventory reservation, and shipment creation. Which service should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Step Functions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a>는 다단계 워크플로의 상태·분기·재시도를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q071\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q077\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q077\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q077</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q077/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A mobile application calls Lambda functions through an HTTPS API and needs authentication and request throttling. Which front-end service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon API Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a>는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 인증·제한 등을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q073\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,1\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q092\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">이전 용어 <b>SQS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">다음 용어 <b>Storage Gateway</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
